      <h2 id="virt-about-node-remediation-strategies_virt-vm-recovery-from-node-failures" class="group scroll-mt-20">Node remediation strategies for OpenShift Virtualization<a href="#virt-about-node-remediation-strategies_virt-vm-recovery-from-node-failures" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
