      <p>You must use FAR for hyperconverged storage configurations. For hyperconverged storage, set the Node Health Check <code>minHealthy</code> property to your total node count minus one. With this setting, FAR does not remediate more than a single worker-node failure within the same zone, storage placement, and replication group to maintain storage stability.</p>
